text: By owner decision LXM-DEC-000010, this Master is adopted as version 1.0.0 in the repository at governance/master/, with PROJECT-CONTEXT and the assimilation gate as the single knowledge system; the sole writer installs it, including the owner's source files SRC-0002 and SRC-0003.
